---
// A one-word rename (title -> name on the open-case body) caught as a diff of the
// generated OpenAPI document against the committed snapshot (test_contract.py capture).
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep9e">
  <div class="bep9e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two JSON fragments side by side. The committed snapshot has a required property title for the open-case body; the generated document has name instead. An arrow between them leads to a red CI failure: the API contract changed.">
    <text x="190" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>committed snapshot</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>snapshot đã commit</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="710" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>app.openapi() today</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>app.openapi() hôm nay</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="44" width="300" height="130" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="58" y="72" class="code">"properties": {'{'}</text>
    <text x="58" y="98" class="code red2">  "title": {'{'} "type": "string" {'}'}</text>
    <text x="58" y="124" class="code">{'}'},</text>
    <text x="58" y="150" class="code">"required": ["title"]</text>
    <rect x="560" y="44" width="300" height="130" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="578" y="72" class="code">"properties": {'{'}</text>
    <text x="578" y="98" class="code red2">  "name": {'{'} "type": "string" {'}'}</text>
    <text x="578" y="124" class="code">{'}'},</text>
    <text x="578" y="150" class="code">"required": ["name"]</text>
    <line x1="350" y1="109" x2="540" y2="109" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="550,109 540,104 540,114" class="hd" />
    <text x="450" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>compare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>so sánh</tspan></text>
    <line x1="710" y1="174" x2="710" y2="212" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="710,222 705,212 715,212" class="hd" />
    <rect x="400" y="226" width="460" height="64" rx="10" class="box redbox" />
    <text x="630" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="fail">
      <tspan data-lang-en>FAILED: the API contract changed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>FAILED: hợp đồng API đã đổi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="630" y="276" text-anchor="middle" class="bs">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the client finds out in CI, not in production</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client biết ở CI, không phải trên production</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Nothing in the service rules changed, so no unit test notices. The generated document is the only place the rename is visible to a caller, and that is what the snapshot pins.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Luật trong service không đổi nên không unit test nào để ý. Tài liệu được sinh ra là chỗ duy nhất bên gọi thấy được việc đổi tên, và snapshot ghim đúng chỗ đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9e .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9e .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9e .red2 { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9e .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep9e .fail { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9e .redbox { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
